OL,3,GNEWSAVillage pub saved from housing
OL,4,Aplan wins award
OL,5,
OL,6,FA landlord who helped save the pub he
OL,7,Fvisited with his family in his youth
OL,8,Fsaid winning an award has been part of
OL,9,Fan "extraordinary journey".
OL,11,FThe New Fountain Inn in Whimple, near
OL,12,FExeter, Devon, had been the focus of a
OL,13,Fplanning application submitted in 2020
OL,14,Fto turn it into a smaller "micro-pub"
OL,15,Fand have three houses in the car park.
OL,17,FThis led to a campaign in the village
OL,18,Fto save the pub before Lee Wheaton took
OL,19,Fover as landlord with his father Kevin.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
