OL,3,GNEWSAVillage pub saved from housing
OL,4,Aplan wins award
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe pub, where Wheaton's grandfather
OL,7,FFrancis would take him and the family
OL,8,Fduring his childhood, has been named
OL,9,FRural Pub of the Year by Exeter & East
OL,10,FDevon Campaign For Real Ale, leaving
OL,11,Fits landlords "over the moon".
